    "result_text": "The build passes with all tests green. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe spec required the owner resource to expose `selfLink = \"/api/owners/\" + <id>`. The acceptance test creates an owner and reads it back via `GET /api/owners/{id}`, asserting `$.selfLink`. Two coordinated edits deliver it:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema (read-only, alongside `id` and the other derived fields). This makes the OpenAPI generator produce the field on the generated `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` for `selfLink` with `expression = \"java(\\\"/api/owners/\\\" + owner.getId())\"`, following the same expression-based pattern the other derived fields already use.\n\nBecause every owner response flows through `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto`, the field is now populated on the create, get, list and update responses consistently. `./mvnw test` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**, `AcceptanceTest` green (1 run, 0 failures).",
